@startuml togaf-overview
title TOGAF 架构概览（ArchiMate）- WhatsFeed
skinparam shadowing false

' ArchiMate 3.x via PlantUML archimate keyword
archimate #Business "终端用户" as ActorUser <<business-actor>>
archimate #Business "管理员" as ActorAdmin <<business-actor>>
archimate #Business "社交与通讯能力" as CapSocial <<business-capability>>
archimate #Business "内容与发现能力" as CapContent <<business-capability>>

archimate #Application "Web / Mobile / Admin" as AppClients <<application-component>>
archimate #Application "WhatsFeed API" as AppApi <<application-component>>
archimate #Application "推荐 / Vision / Media" as AppSide <<application-component>>
archimate #Application "REST / GraphQL / WS" as AppIf <<application-interface>>

archimate #Application "用户 / 帖子 / 消息 / Feed" as DataCore <<data-object>>

archimate #Technology "NestJS 运行时" as TechNode <<technology-node>>
archimate #Technology "PostgreSQL" as TechPg <<system-software>>
archimate #Technology "Redis" as TechRedis <<system-software>>
archimate #Technology "Docker Compose / 托管平台" as TechPlat <<technology-node>>

ActorUser --> CapSocial : Assignment
ActorAdmin --> CapContent : Assignment
CapSocial ..> AppClients : Realization
CapContent ..> AppApi : Realization
AppClients --> AppIf : Serving
AppApi --> AppIf : Serving
AppApi --> AppSide : Serving
AppApi --> DataCore : Access
AppSide --> DataCore : Access
TechNode --> AppApi : Assignment
TechPg --> DataCore : Realization
TechRedis --> AppApi : Serving
TechPlat --> TechNode : Realization
TechPlat --> TechPg : Realization
TechPlat --> TechRedis : Realization

legend right
  |= 层 |= ArchiMate |
  | Business | Actor / Capability |
  | Application | Component / Interface / Data Object |
  | Technology | Node / System Software |
  | 关系 | Assignment / Realization / Serving / Access |
endlegend

@enduml
